      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start for a factual summary, but i'm worried it's a bit too dry. the sentiment score on this version came back pretty low (around 0.2), which tells me it might not actually move people to donate. \n\nwe don't want it to be cringey or over-the-top, but we definitely need more emotional resonance. can you try a second draft that brings the sentiment score up a bit? just focus on making it feel more inspiring and heartfelt without losing that professional grounding i mentioned before.",
